    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Role of a Healer in a Relaxing Fantasy World</strong> In this charming life-simulation game, you\u2019ve been invited by the Adventurer\u2019s Guild to manage a cozy infirmary in a vibrant village. Unwind as you explore lush landscapes, nurture your garden, and connect with the community at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Soothing Remedies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/5a6b7cf88228ad3b5d9114a622141bac.poster.avif?t=1743647097\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/5a6b7cf88228ad3b5d9114a622141bac.webm?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/5a6b7cf88228ad3b5d9114a622141bac.mp4?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help adventurers recover after their journeys by crafting remedies from unique ingredients. Match reagent properties to enhance their potency, or simply enjoy the process of experimenting with new combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Connections</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/3c37edd6cd1f40ad0553a587570d0e37.poster.avif?t=1743647097\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/3c37edd6cd1f40ad0553a587570d0e37.webm?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/3c37edd6cd1f40ad0553a587570d0e37.mp4?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time getting to know your neighbors through meaningful conversations and leisurely quests. Discover their stories, form friendships, and perhaps find romance along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cultivate Your Herbal Garden</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/782cc07c13f0eb975d542aeaf98821e4.poster.avif?t=1743647097\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/782cc07c13f0eb975d542aeaf98821e4.webm?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/782cc07c13f0eb975d542aeaf98821e4.mp4?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a variety of herbs essential for your remedies. Tend to their individual needs, from watering to soil nutrition, and relish the calming rhythm of caring for your crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Tranquil Biomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/1a3a7ce29bae76671d6043231e11a90d.poster.avif?t=1743647097\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/1a3a7ce29bae76671d6043231e11a90d.webm?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/1a3a7ce29bae76671d6043231e11a90d.mp4?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through diverse biomes in search of rare ingredients with unique properties. Each area has its own beauty and secrets, waiting for you to uncover them at your leisure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the hustle and immerse yourself in a world of healing, exploration, and connection. Your journey to becoming the village\u2019s cherished healer begins here.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Role of a Healer in a Relaxing Fantasy World</strong> In this charming life-simulation game, you\u2019ve been invited by the Adventurer\u2019s Guild to manage a cozy infirmary in a vibrant village. Unwind as you explore lush landscapes, nurture your garden, and connect with the community at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Soothing Remedies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/5a6b7cf88228ad3b5d9114a622141bac.poster.avif?t=1743647097\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/5a6b7cf88228ad3b5d9114a622141bac.webm?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/5a6b7cf88228ad3b5d9114a622141bac.mp4?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help adventurers recover after their journeys by crafting remedies from unique ingredients. Match reagent properties to enhance their potency, or simply enjoy the process of experimenting with new combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Connections</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/3c37edd6cd1f40ad0553a587570d0e37.poster.avif?t=1743647097\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/3c37edd6cd1f40ad0553a587570d0e37.webm?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/3c37edd6cd1f40ad0553a587570d0e37.mp4?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time getting to know your neighbors through meaningful conversations and leisurely quests. Discover their stories, form friendships, and perhaps find romance along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cultivate Your Herbal Garden</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/782cc07c13f0eb975d542aeaf98821e4.poster.avif?t=1743647097\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/782cc07c13f0eb975d542aeaf98821e4.webm?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/782cc07c13f0eb975d542aeaf98821e4.mp4?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a variety of herbs essential for your remedies. Tend to their individual needs, from watering to soil nutrition, and relish the calming rhythm of caring for your crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Tranquil Biomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/1a3a7ce29bae76671d6043231e11a90d.poster.avif?t=1743647097\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/1a3a7ce29bae76671d6043231e11a90d.webm?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364910/extras/1a3a7ce29bae76671d6043231e11a90d.mp4?t=1743647097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through diverse biomes in search of rare ingredients with unique properties. Each area has its own beauty and secrets, waiting for you to uncover them at your leisure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the hustle and immerse yourself in a world of healing, exploration, and connection. Your journey to becoming the village\u2019s cherished healer begins here.</p>",
    "short_description": "In this life-sim, you are sent by the adventurer\u2019s guild to run a local infirmary. Explore diverse biomes to gather ingredients, nurture your herbs and concoct remedies to aid your guild. Build relationships with your neighbors and engage in community events.",
